                <h2>Our Team</h2>
                <h3>Founder&apos;s Story</h3>
                <h4>Kumar Modi &mdash; Founder &amp; Director </h3>
                <p>Kumar Modi founded <strong>2N1</strong> with a firm belief in the transformative power of software&period; Following a successful tenure at a major Hong Kong&dash;based corporation&dash;specialising in technology&comma; ports&comma; and retail&comma; he witnessed how large IT providers often dominate B2B software with generic solutions that lack personalisation and value&period; This inspired him to choose a different path&colon; acquiring and nurturing SaaS companies that deliver real impact and innovation&period;</p>
                <p>To Kumar&comma; software is not merely a commodity&comma; it is a <strong>platform for future innovation</strong>&period; Under his leadership&comma; 2N1 has focused on serving sectors that are often overlooked&period; A prime example is <strong><a href="/companies/#rapid-information-systems" title="Rapid Information Systems">Rapid Information Systems</a></strong>&comma; one of the companies in the 2N1 family&period; Powered by a low&dash;code platform&comma; Rapid delivers tailored digital transformation to UK local authorities&comma; housing associations&comma; and charities&comma; helping them streamline service delivery&comma; manage compliance&comma; and drive efficiency in property maintenance and public services&period;</p>
                <p>Leadership at 2N1 is <strong>values&dash;driven and empowering</strong>&period; Kumar sets a clear strategic vision and grants his teams the autonomy to take responsibility and grow&period; By fostering a culture of knowledge&dash;sharing and cross&dash;company collaboration&comma; 2N1 enables teams to implement best practices and unlock cross&dash;selling opportunities&dash;creating ripple effects of innovation and value across its portfolio&period;</p>
                <p>Central to Kumar&apos;s ethos is a commitment to <strong>smarter solutions with meaningful and measurable impact</strong>&period; When not steering 2N1 toward its ambitious goals&comma; you will often find him out cycling&dash;pursuing his passion with the same determination and enthusiasm he brings to his professional life&period;</p>
